            {
              "content": "=Write a short, friendly renewal reminder email body for an HVAC maintenance plan customer.\n\nCustomer name: {{ $json.customer_name }}\nPlan: {{ $json.plan_type }}\nPlan expires on: {{ $json.plan_end_date }}\nDays left: {{ $json.days_left }}\nReminder stage: {{ $json.stage }}\n\nRules:\n- Max 90 words, plain text only, no markdown, no subject line\n- Tone: 30d = gentle, 14d = helpful reminder, 7d = polite but urgent\n- Do NOT invent prices, discounts or offers\n- Mention the expiry date and end with the line: Renew here: [PAYMENT_LINK]\n- Sign off as: The HVAC Service Team"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
